  "implementation": {
    "component": "FixedActivatedManaAbilitySpec, IntrinsicBasicLandManaSpec, typed CardProgram card-form declarations, activation query, ManaAbilityRuntime, and the canonical mana-activation transaction, fixed_resolution_mana compiler, existing spell/trigger/loyalty stack and semantic mana effect owners",
    "version": "typed-mana-ability-v4",
    "capability_ids": [
      "mana.activated.fixed_output",
      "mana.activated.restricted_fixed_output",
      "mana.intrinsic.basic_land_type",
      "mana.production.fixed_resolution"
    ],
    "supported_slice": "Target-free nonloyalty activated mana abilities with fully compiled fixed output modes and costs, the exact Powerstone colorless restriction and artifact-only or creature-only selectable any-color restrictions, plus CR 305.6 intrinsic abilities derived from current effective basic land types. Fixed-symbol resolution mana uses ordinary spell, entry-trigger or loyalty timing, and independently closed costs; represented typed spending restrictions use canonical mana provenance and public payment predicates."
  },
  "known_blockers": [
    "the CR 605.1a exclusion for costs or effects that move cards to or from a library is not yet a complete typed classifier outside the closed fixed-output families",
    "triggered mana abilities are not generically identified or dispatched outside the stack",
    "dynamic, conditional, side-effecting, fixed-colored restricted, and spending restrictions outside the three exact represented forms remain outside the fixed-output capabilities",
    "explicit mana activation during arbitrary rule/effect payment windows is not exposed as a general nested decision",
    "activation reentrancy is not represented as a state that can be independently tested",
    "mana-production replacement and trigger integration is incomplete",
    "Resolution-time variable or chosen-color output, conditional self-replacements such as Threshold, and unrepresented linked effects remain residuals."
  ],
